WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.748 --> 00:00:04.910
Roxy gulped.

2
00:00:13.537 --> 00:00:14.378
are you okay?"

3
00:00:15.359 --> 00:00:16.380
Terrell cleared his throat.

4
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.304
"I'm fine, but I'm trapped inside the plant.

5
00:00:22.065 --> 00:00:24.407
We were looking at it when one of the bulbs opened.

6
00:00:25.007 --> 00:00:26.128
It looked like a big mouth.

7
00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:28.350
It ate Jack.

8
00:00:28.931 --> 00:00:30.352
Another mouth ate Mara.

9
00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:34.497
Before I could run away, the plant got me."

10
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:38.378
"Don't worry, Terrell!"

11
00:00:38.618 --> 00:00:39.198
Roxy said.

12
00:00:39.218 --> 00:00:41.119
"I'll be there right away!"

13
00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:43.919
"Come quickly," Terrell said.

14
00:00:43.939 --> 00:00:47.640
"I'm beginning to feel He yawned.

15
00:00:50.621 --> 00:00:53.982
"Sleepy." Roxy closed her watch.

16
00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:57.483
"Listen, Detective, I need to—" Smash!

17
00:00:58.543 --> 00:01:01.004
A vine shattered the window and grabbed the detective.

18
00:01:02.468 --> 00:01:05.691
"Grr!" Detective Smith tried to wriggle free.

19
00:01:06.331 --> 00:01:07.132
"Rocket Girl!

20
00:01:07.172 --> 00:01:08.974
Help—" Gulp!

21
00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:10.995
The plant swallowed the detective.

22
00:01:11.015 --> 00:01:13.197
"Ahh!" Roxy screamed.

23
00:01:13.938 --> 00:01:15.659
Then another vine reached into the office.

24
00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:17.921
Roxy escaped down the hallway.

25
00:01:18.822 --> 00:01:20.343
She flew out through a window.

26
00:01:20.363 --> 00:01:22.765
"Oh no!"

27
00:01:23.206 --> 00:01:23.886
Roxy cried.

28
00:01:24.927 --> 00:01:26.408
Giant plants were everywhere.

29
00:01:27.129 --> 00:01:28.530
Vines whipped back and forth.

30
00:01:29.531 --> 00:01:32.040
Mouths snapped at people.

31
00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.642
Below each mouth hung several pods.

32
00:01:34.542 --> 00:01:35.663
Many of the pods wiggled.

33
00:01:35.683 --> 00:01:38.165
"Whoa," Roxy said.

34
00:01:38.185 --> 00:01:40.447
"There are people in those pods!"

35
00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:44.150
"The plants are eating people!"

36
00:01:44.551 --> 00:01:45.551
an old woman shouted.

37
00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:49.174
"Run for your lives!"

38
00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:50.195
a man cried.

39
00:01:50.215 --> 00:01:52.777
"Don't let the plants—" Gulp!

40
00:01:53.398 --> 00:01:54.619
A giant mouth grabbed him.

41
00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:00.544
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted the plant's mouth, and the man jumped out.

42
00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.581
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

43
00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:03.842
He ran down the street.

44
00:02:04.122 --> 00:02:05.643
But then—gulp!

45
00:02:06.624 --> 00:02:07.564
Another plant got him.

46
00:02:07.584 --> 00:02:10.827
"Ugh!" Roxy made a fist.

47
00:02:11.387 --> 00:02:14.129
"How can I stop all these plants from eating people?"

48
00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:16.651
Roxy heard someone laughing.

49
00:02:17.631 --> 00:02:19.493
A small spaceship floated nearby.

50
00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:21.874
The top of the spaceship opened.

51
00:02:22.555 --> 00:02:24.997
A woman sat inside, operating the controls.

52
00:02:26.157 --> 00:02:27.338
Roxy's eyes went wide.

53
00:02:27.358 --> 00:02:29.640
"Vic Nebula!"

54
00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.701
"Hello, Rocket Girl."

55
00:02:33.001 --> 00:02:34.662
The villain had an evil smile.

56
00:02:34.682 --> 00:02:37.563
"Are you surprised to see me again?"

57
00:02:37.583 --> 00:02:40.284
"I thought you were gone forever!"

58
00:02:40.724 --> 00:02:41.404
Roxy said.

59
00:02:42.805 --> 00:02:43.925
Vic narrowed her eyes.

60
00:02:43.945 --> 00:02:49.087
"I almost was—after you pushed me through that wormhole!"

61
00:02:49.888 --> 00:02:50.788
She gritted her teeth.

62
00:02:50.808 --> 00:02:54.190
"But luckily I landed on a safe planet.

63
00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:58.091
And while I was there, I made some new friends!"

64
00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.872
"The plants?"

65
00:03:00.284 --> 00:03:00.985
Roxy asked.

66
00:03:02.045 --> 00:03:02.605
Vic nodded.

67
00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:06.267
"They store living things in their pods.

68
00:03:06.688 --> 00:03:09.049
Then they feed off their victims' energy."

69
00:03:09.069 --> 00:03:11.810
"Why are you doing this?"

70
00:03:12.111 --> 00:03:12.791
Roxy asked.

71
00:03:12.811 --> 00:03:15.212
"I want revenge!"

72
00:03:15.672 --> 00:03:16.293
Vic snapped.

73
00:03:16.313 --> 00:03:19.054
"I could have been lost in space forever!

74
00:03:19.615 --> 00:03:23.297
Now my plants will destroy every person in Metro City.

75
00:03:23.997 --> 00:03:25.618
Even you, Rocket Girl!"

76
00:03:26.838 --> 00:03:29.240
Roxy suddenly felt a vine wrap tightly around her.

77
00:03:30.186 --> 00:03:30.589
And then
